sourcebolt is written from scratch in Go. As of this version no source code
from the projects below has been copied into this repository. Designs, tool
surfaces and wire-format knowledge (RPC ids and payload layouts, later pinned
by our own live captures) were learned, with thanks, from these MIT- or
Apache-2.0-licensed projects (details in research/notes/). If code is ever
copied from one of them, its copyright notice and license text must be added
here before the change is merged:
- teng-lin/notebooklm-py (MIT)
- tmc/nlm (MIT)
- jacob-bd/gemini-notebook-mcp-cli (MIT)
- LocalKinAI/notebooklm-go (Apache-2.0)

Projects with no license or a copyleft license were read for behavior only
and nothing from them was used.

tools/internal/schemas/ holds unmodified copies of two JSON Schemas from the
Model Context Protocol project (MCPB manifest v0.3 and the MCP registry
server.json schema 2025-12-11), used only by build-time checks. They are
licensed by the MCP project under Apache-2.0 (earlier contributions MIT).
